        "3": {
            "ID": "2011213",
            "URL": "https://thetvdb.com/series/381536-/seasons/official/3",
            "Titles": {
                "eng": "Book 3 - In The Capital",
                "jpn": null,
                "deu": "Fairies Albums 3",
                "por": "Livro 3 - Na Capital"
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "The story revolves around the travels of Tao Yao, Liu Gongzi and Moya in the capital, showing that the distance between humans and demons may not be as insurmountable as one might think. Whether it is the interaction between Tao Yao and Ding San Si, or the guidance that Lao Zhang brings to Liu Gongzi across life and cooking, or the dilemma of Moya when facing the servant's bag, each of the group grows in new ways. At the same time, Feng Wule, Chen Baishui and the others also gain their own redemption. Perhaps this is how life's journey affects each other, with its many flavours.",
                "jpn": null,
                "deu": "In Fairies Album 3 begleiten wir die Geisterärztin Tao Yao, den Mönch Moya und Herrn Liu auf ihrer Reise, die sie erstmal in die Hauptstadt führt. Dort treffen sie auf ihrer Suche nach dem Feenalbum auf allerhand Geister und Menschen, die ihre Hilfe brauchen.",
                "por": "A história gira em torno das viagens de Tao Yao, Liu Gongzi e Mo Ya pela capital, mostrando que a distância entre humanos e demónios pode não ser tão intransponível quanto se pensa. Quer seja a interação entre Tao Yao e Ding San Si, ou a orientação que Lao Zhang traz a Liu Gongzi sobre a vida e a culinária, ou o dilema de Mo Ya ao enfrentar a bolsa de escravos, cada membro do grupo cresce de forma diferente. Ao mesmo tempo, Feng Wule, Chen Baishui e os outros também ganham sua própria redenção. Talvez seja assim que o percurso da vida se afecta mutuamente, com os seus múltiplos sabores."
            },
